#: ../../source/prompts_readme.md:31
msgid ""
"**Simple**: prompts has [no big "
"dependencies](http://npm.anvaka.com/#/view/2d/prompts) nor is it broken "
"into a [dozen](http://npm.anvaka.com/#/view/2d/inquirer) tiny modules "
"that only work well together."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prompts_readme.md:32
msgid ""
"**User friendly**: prompt uses layout and colors to create beautiful cli "
"interfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prompts_readme.md:33
msgid "**Promised**: uses promises and `async`/`await`. No callback hell."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prompts_readme.md:34
msgid "**Flexible**: all prompts are independent and can be used on their own."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prompts_readme.md:35
msgid "**Testable**: provides a way to submit answers programmatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prompts_readme.md:36
msgid "**Unified**: consistent experience across all [prompts](#-types)."
msgstr ""

