msgid ""
"Each property be of type `function` and will be invoked right before "
"prompting the user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prompts_readme.md:326
msgid ""
"The function signature is `(prev, values, prompt)`, where `prev` is the "
"value from the previous prompt, `values` is the response object with all "
"values collected so far and `prompt` is the previous prompt object."
msgstr ""

