msgid "name"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prompts_readme.md:359
msgid ""
"The response will be saved under this key/property in the returned "
"response object. In case you have multiple prompts with the same name "
"only the latest response will be stored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prompts_readme.md:362
msgid ""
"Make sure to give prompts unique names if you don't want to overwrite "
"previous values."
msgstr ""

